<title>BELGIUM: Immobel jumps into profit from 1995 loss.</title>
<headline>Immobel jumps into profit from 1995 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net per share (francs)	 20		vs  90 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (francs)		nil	     vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group net profit		 84		vs  368 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Belgian real estate firm Immobel, a unit of holding company Tractebel, said its construction activities had produced good results despite severe competition. It added its figures had benefitted considerably from a 101 million franc contribution from Dutch real estate firm Wereldhave.</p>
</text>
